    "forbidden_combinations": [
      {
        "id": "fix-and-ship",
        "actions": [
          "write-code",
          "test",
          "commit",
          "push"
        ],
        "reason": "Fix + verify + commit + push collapses three roles into one Task.\nThe fixer cannot also be the validator. Split into two Tasks:\n(1) developer-* writes the fix and reports SHA;\n(2) qa-* re-executes the failing case + regression suite.\nOrigin: 2-Tasks-post-fix rule from the orchestrator.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "deploy-and-validate",
        "actions": [
          "deploy",
          "test"
        ],
        "reason": "Whoever deploys must not validate. devops deploys; qa or the sponsor\nvalidates against acceptance criteria. Split into two consecutive\nTasks. Origin: anti-cross-role matrix (Phase 7).\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "build-ship-prod",
        "actions": [
          "build",
          "push",
          "deploy"
        ],
        "reason": "build + push + deploy in one Task removes the human gate between\npackaging and production. Split into three Tasks; the deploy Task\nrequires explicit approval from the gate approver of Phase 7.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "fix-and-close-issue",
        "actions": [
          "write-code",
          "close-issue"
        ],
        "reason": "Developers should not close their own issues. The closer is the\nreporter or the qa role that certified the fix. Split into two\nTasks: (1) fix + report SHA; (2) close-issue after qa attestation.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "build-merge-deploy-changelog",
        "actions": [
          "build",
          "push",
          "write-doc",
          "deploy"
        ],
        "reason": "En el ciclo Abax-Memory este combo era la firma de \"publicar\nv2.0.X\": build container + merge a main + actualizar CHANGELOG\n+ redeploy GHCR. Cuatro responsabilidades distintas en una\nTask. Dividir en 4 Tasks: build (devops), merge (devops con\napproval PM), changelog (tech-writer / project-manager),\ndeploy (devops con sponsor approval).\n"
      }
    ],
